cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IFEP, please cite this software and the associated research publication."
title: "IFEP: Integrated Fast Evolutionary Programming — Automated Material Identification"
abstract: >-
  IFEP (Integrated Fast Evolutionary Programming) is MATLAB research software for
  automated identification of material parameters in nonlinear constitutive models.
  It implements an integrated self-adaptive and multi-strategy evolutionary
  programming framework for fast automated material identification of creep damage
  constitutive models.
type: software
authors:
